<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Happy Birthday ❤️</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffb6c1, #d8b4fe);
            color: white;
        }

        .container {
            padding: 30px 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 40px;
            color: #fff;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px #ff1493;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #fff0f5;
        }

        .message {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            max-width: 600px;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .gallery {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 25px;
        }

        .gallery img {
            width: 220px;
            height: 250px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 4px solid white;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            transition: 0.4s;
        }

        .gallery img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.08);
        }

        button {
            background: #ff1493;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 18px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin: 20px;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: #c71585;
        }

        #surprise {
            display: none;
            font-size: 23px;
            margin: 20px;
            color: white;
        }

        footer {
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 17px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>🎂 Happy Birthday! 🎉</h1>

    <h2>To My Special Person ❤️</h2>

    <div class="message">
        Happy Birthday to the most amazing person! 💗

        May your life always be filled with happiness,
        endless smiles and beautiful memories.

        Thank you for being a wonderful part of my life.
        Every moment with you is special.

        Keep smiling and shining always! ❤️
    </div>

    <h2>📸 Our Beautiful Memories</h2>

    <div class="gallery">

        <img src="photo1.jpg" alt="Our Memory 1">

        <img src="photo2.jpg" alt="Our Memory 2">

        <img src="photo3.jpg" alt="Our Memory 3">

        <img src="photo4.jpg" alt="Our Memory 4">

    </div>

    <h2>🎁 A Little Surprise For You</h2>

    <button onclick="showSurprise()">
        Click For Surprise ❤️
    </button>

    <div id="surprise">
        You are one of the most beautiful memories
        of my life! 💕

        <br><br>

        Stay Happy, Stay Blessed! 🥰

        <br>

        Happy Birthday Once Again! 🎂
    </div>

    <footer>
        Made With ❤️ Just For You
    </footer>

</div>

<script>
    function showSurprise() {
        document.getElementById("surprise").style.display = "block";
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>
